    "text": "By Sarah Sims ,\n5 hours ago ENTERPRISE, Ala. (WTVY) - Enterprise High School standout Addie Reagan is officially taking her talents to the next level, signing to continue her softball career at the University of Montevallo. Reagan, a versatile 1B/C/OF for the Wildcats, has been one of Enterprise’s most consistent offensive threats. As a junior last... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
